{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>And all the people, etc.</b> Meaning: even so, it will eat you up — the land. Or it may intend an examination of the verse's saying <b>within it</b>, to say that all who maintained themselves within it were men of measure, and because of this the land was able to consume them; but all who were not men of measure stood outside it, so that the land would not consume them."], :book :numbers, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T20:08:35.741718829Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}